flowchart LR
  CTS["CTS Spring"]
  API["DPS REST API ×2"]
  SQL[("MySQL · cov_monitoring")]
  SOURCE[("CTS document store")]
  DERIVED[("DPS derived storage")]
  WORKER["DPS workers · 3 Standard, 1 Heavy"]
  PARSER["Parser sidecars ×4"]
  EXTRACT["Extraction pipeline · skills, rules, validation"]
  AGENT["CrewAI Document Agent"]
  GATE["AI gateway"]
  AZURE["Azure OpenAI"]

  CTS <-->|HTTPS REST · Bearer token| API
  API <-->|Jobs · results| SQL
  API -->|File check · evidence read| SOURCE
  API <-->|Evidence previews · saved page reads| DERIVED
  SOURCE -->|Source bytes · read only| WORKER
  WORKER <-->|Claim lease · save results · index files| SQL
  WORKER <-->|Load and save page models| DERIVED
  WORKER <-->|Unix socket · bytes and pages| PARSER
  WORKER -.->|CTS lookups · optional event push| CTS
  WORKER -->|Page model| EXTRACT
  EXTRACT <-->|AI reads| AGENT
  EXTRACT <-->|Direct model reads| GATE
  AGENT <-->|Agent model calls| GATE
  GATE <-->|Model calls| AZURE
